OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 8 Aug to Mon 17 Aug
OL,6,FRather changeable to begin this
OL,7,Fperiod, with some rain or showers at
OL,8,Ftimes, but also the likelihood of some
OL,9,Fdecent drier interludes too,
OL,10,Fespecially in the south. Towards mid
OL,11,FAugust, high pressure may become
OL,12,Frather more dominant towards the north
OL,13,For northwest of the UK, with lower
OL,14,Fpressure at times further to the south
OL,15,For east. This means there is a greater
OL,16,Fchance of frontal systems or thundery
OL,17,Finterludes to affect southern and
OL,18,Feastern areas, certainly in comparison
OL,19,Fto recent weeks, though rainfall
OL,20,Famounts could be quite variable with
OL,21,Fsome areas seeing relatively little.
OL,22,FFor the most part, temperatures look
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fto remain above average, especially in
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Fthe south, though perhaps without the
OL,25,Fexceptional heat we have seen in
OL,26,Frecent weeks.
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
PN,16303
SC,0003
CT,20,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1785770311
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G3/3
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tue 18 Aug to Tue 1 SepFA
OL,6,Fcontinuation of the broad theme of
OL,7,Fhigh pressure remaining in place at
OL,8,Fleast close to the UK, but with
OL,9,Foccasional more unsettled or
OL,10,Fchangeable interludes, either
OL,11,Fresulting from Atlantic frontal
OL,12,Fsystems or thundery plumes. This means
OL,13,Fthat rainfall amounts overall are more
OL,14,Flikely to be below normal than above.
OL,15,FTemperatures will probably be above
OL,16,Faverage and some spells of hot weather
OL,17,Fand heatwaves are possible, especially
OL,18,Fin the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
